.TH "KOSH" "1" "October 26, 2026" "kosh" "Koshka Manual"
.SH NAME
kosh \- a reference to shell commands, interactive editing, diagnostics,
and bundled utilities on Linux, macOS, and Windows
.PP
\f[CR]kosh\f[R] is the Koshka shell, with a formatter, a language
server, and script diagnostics.
It accepts POSIX shell syntax and the Bash extensions described in this
manual.
The same grammar is available on Linux, macOS, and Windows.
.SH DOWNLOADS
Koshka releases are available for Linux, macOS, and Windows.
Choose the binary for your operating system and processor.
Replace \f[CR]X.Y.Z\f[R] below with the release version.
.PP
